          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Voraussetzung is the noun of voraussetzen, built from voraus \"ahead\" and setzen \"to set\", Proto-Germanic satjaną (EtymDB): what is set in place beforehand."
            }
          ]
        },
