          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: sofern",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sofern — \"provided that, as long as\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Wir grillen am Samstag, sofern das Wetter gut ist. We are having a barbecue on Saturday, provided the weather is good."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sofern sends the verb to the end, like wenn: …, sofern das Wetter gut ist. It sounds a little more formal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sofern joins so and fern \"far\", from Old High German ferrana (EtymDB): \"so far as\", to the extent that something holds."
            }
          ]
        },
