          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "soweit joins so and weit \"wide, far\", inherited from Middle High German wīt, Old High German wīt and Proto-Germanic wīdaz (EtymDB), a cousin of English wide."
